  "reference": "Joel 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that came to Joel the son of Pethuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this, ye old men, and give ear, all ye inhabitants of the land. Hath this been in your days, or even in the days of your fathers?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell ye your children of it, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "let",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your children",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "tell",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their children, and their children another generation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That which the palmerworm hath left hath the locust eaten; and that which the locust hath left hath the cankerworm eaten; and that which the cankerworm hath left hath the caterpiller eaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awake, ye drunkards, and weep; and howl, all ye drinkers of wine, because of the new wine; for it is cut off from your mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a nation is come up upon my land, strong, and without number, whose teeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the teeth of a lion, and he hath the cheek teeth of a great lion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath laid my vine waste, and barked my fig tree: he hath made it clean bare, and cast",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "away; the branches thereof are made white.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Lament like a virgin girded with sackcloth for the husband of her youth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The meat offering and the drink offering is cut off from the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; the priests, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ministers, mourn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The field is wasted, the land mourneth; for the corn is wasted: the new wine is dried up, the oil languisheth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be ye ashamed, O ye husbandmen; howl, O ye vinedressers, for the wheat and for the barley; because the harvest of the field is perished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The vine is dried up, and the fig tree languisheth; the pomegranate tree, the palm tree also, and the apple tree,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the trees of the field, are withered: because joy is withered away from the sons of men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gird yourselves, and lament, ye priests: howl, ye ministers of the altar: come, lie all night in sackcloth, ye ministers of my God: for the meat offering and the drink offering is withholden from the house of your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Sanctify ye a fast, call a solemn assembly, gather the elders",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the inhabitants of the land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "into",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, and cry unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alas for the day! for the day of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at hand, and as a destruction from the Almighty shall it come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is not the meat cut off before our eyes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yea",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", joy and gladness from the house of our God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seed is rotten under their clods, the garners are laid desolate, the barns are broken down; for the corn is withered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How do the beasts groan! the herds of cattle are perplexed, because they have no pasture; yea, the flocks of sheep are made desolate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOL.1.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to thee will I cry: for the fire hath devoured the pastures of the wilderness, and the flame hath burned all the trees of the field.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beasts of the field cry also unto thee: for the rivers of waters are dried up, and the fire hath devoured the pastures of the wilderness.",
